{"chapter": "spaces", "node_kind": "proof", "parent_tag": "03I3", "placeholders": {"REF_0001": "\\ref{sites-lemma-essential-image-j-shriek}", "REF_0002": "\\ref{lemma-category-of-spaces-over-smaller-base-scheme}"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{proof}\n", "suffix": "\\end{proof}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:44136fa355b3678a1146ad16f7e8649e94fb4fc21fe77e8310c060f61caaff8a", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:cc19850085e2db9aec6b7de4000dad61931addceac6eb72691c2175e583b5fcf", "source_text": "The restriction and the product match under\nthe equivalence of categories of\nSites, Lemma <REF_0001>\nso that\nLemma <REF_0002>\nabove gives the result.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:1b05efa7af793153363f340f677c9a7a376e5220a1b98451a51834ac01a2e1b1", "unit_id": "tag:04SH:proof"}
{"chapter": "spaces", "node_kind": "paragraph", "parent_tag": "03I3", "placeholders": {"STRUCT_0001": "\\noindent"}, "render": {"prefix": "", "suffix": ""}, "risk_level": "R2", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:44136fa355b3678a1146ad16f7e8649e94fb4fc21fe77e8310c060f61caaff8a", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:d65ec34f1b9fd6ba9200a62474877a1b3b4236ba5184448661d3e9faceb10e9a", "source_text": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\nWe finish this section with a lemma on a compatibility.\n\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:920fd2cd9f303c77153c66eb45a43d2a45b6a9ce1238b39ea38d1729320bb1c7", "unit_id": "tag:03I3:prose-0005"}
{"chapter": "spaces", "node_kind": "lemma", "parent_tag": "03I3", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$\\Sch_{fppf}$", "MATH_0002": "$S \\to S'$", "MATH_0003": "$F$", "MATH_0004": "$S$", "MATH_0005": "$T$", "MATH_0006": "$S$", "MATH_0007": "$f : T \\to F$", "MATH_0008": "$S$", "MATH_0009": "$f' : T' \\to F'$", "MATH_0010": "$S'$", "MATH_0011": "$f$", "MATH_0012": "$\\mathcal{P}$", "MATH_0013": "$\\mathcal{P}(f') \\Leftrightarrow \\mathcal{P}(f)$", "REF_0001": "\\ref{lemma-category-of-spaces-over-smaller-base-scheme}", "REF_0002": "\\ref{definition-relative-representable-property}"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{lemma}\n\\label{lemma-viewed-as-properties}\n", "suffix": "\\end{lemma}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:f234f1ca07423afbdefc886e915d9c7cfd29029de71e21e2067b901242d93b82", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:7be7602fc5d4c0146b4214d9bdbd4bcc8f05494d007934faad0c034da0b084a9", "source_text": "Let <MATH_0001> be a big fppf site.\nLet <MATH_0002> be a morphism of this site.\nLet <MATH_0003> be an algebraic space over <MATH_0004>.\nLet <MATH_0005> be a scheme over <MATH_0006> and let <MATH_0007> be\na morphism over <MATH_0008>.\nLet <MATH_0009> be the morphism over <MATH_0010> we get from\n<MATH_0011> by applying the equivalence of categories described in\nLemma <REF_0001>.\nFor any property <MATH_0012> as in\nDefinition <REF_0002>\nwe have <MATH_0013>.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:820584dc130291c4beff54e26c31f6fff2be78d2d92fee2b046996396145d1a3", "unit_id": "tag:03I6:statement"}
{"chapter": "spaces", "node_kind": "proof", "parent_tag": "03I3", "placeholders": {"ACCENT_0001": "\\'e", "ACCENT_0002": "\\'e", "MATH_0001": "$U$", "MATH_0002": "$S$", "MATH_0003": "$U \\to F$", "MATH_0004": "$U'$", "MATH_0005": "$U$", "MATH_0006": "$S'$", "MATH_0007": "$U' \\to F'$", "MATH_0008": "$$\nj(T \\times_{f, F} U) = T' \\times_{f', F'} U'\n$$", "MATH_0009": "$T \\times_{f, F} U \\to U$", "MATH_0010": "$T' \\times_{f', F'} U' \\to U'$", "REF_0001": "\\ref{lemma-change-base-scheme}", "REF_0002": "\\ref{lemma-representable-morphisms-spaces-property}"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{proof}\n", "suffix": "\\end{proof}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:bb266ab0d54823a1375f0b8e4918b41b730d808267f49ce38ca26e2c25c93e1d", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:f4e462fcb42b821abcda8aa301af1cf06e71d69a9c6f22f095c50f36781cc9b0", "source_text": "Suppose that <MATH_0001> is a scheme over <MATH_0002>, and <MATH_0003> is a surjective <ACCENT_0001>tale\nmorphism. Denote <MATH_0004> the scheme <MATH_0005> viewed as a scheme over <MATH_0006>. In\nLemma <REF_0001>\nwe have seen that <MATH_0007> is surjective <ACCENT_0002>tale. Since\n<MATH_0008>\nthe morphism of schemes <MATH_0009>\nis identified with the morphism of schemes\n<MATH_0010>.\nIt is the same morphism, just viewed over different base schemes.\nHence the lemma follows from\nLemma <REF_0002>.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:fa7a61e255fbded3da9f92326f005ca69f435728163d23df6b8411eb5cf7e241", "unit_id": "tag:03I6:proof"}
